  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 808879419392
    m_Localized: 'Kyung.


      Even if your father is no longer by your side,

      make
      sure you never skip a meal.

      Do not deceive others, and do not turn away
      from those in need.

      If you do just that, your father will ask for nothing
      more.


      I am always proud of you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 327833326481408
    m_Localized: 'To my master.


      The information that a fragment was discovered
      in Cheongpung Village was true.


      To avoid suspicion, I had the Greenwood
      stronghold attack Cheongpung Village on my orders.


      The Martial Alliance
      will also conclude that it was the work of the Greenwood bandits.


      However,
      the fragment has yet to be found.


      Once the fragment is recovered, I
      will erase the Greenwood stronghold as well, leaving no trace behind.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 327833376813056
    m_Localized: 'Brother is acting strange.


      He was a rough man, yes,

      but
      he was never a madman obsessed with bloodshed like this.


      I think it
      has something to do with that fragment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
